================================================================================

The 3D diorama subsystem adapted from ZallaxDev/emerald-3ds (>= 0.5.0) is
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
International License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0):

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Specifically:
- Derived from ZallaxDev/emerald-3ds (>= 0.5.0) and ported to PS Vita:
  3ds_field_view.*, voxel_arena.*, voxel_battle.*, voxel_building.*,
  voxel_grade.*, voxel_lighting.*, voxel_regions.*, voxel_relief.*,
  voxel_sign.*, voxel_sprite_slots.*, voxel_swoop.*, voxel_tree.*,
  voxel_tuning.h, voxel_unswizzle.h, voxel_renderer.c, and
  port/docs/VITA_VOXEL_VISUAL_LIMITATIONS.md.
- Mixed ancestry (originally derived from MIT-licensed pokeemerald-multiplatform
  scaffolding, rewritten/expanded under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 in emerald-3ds >= 0.5.0,
  and adapted here under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0):
  voxel_world.*, voxel_camera.*, voxel_mesh_builder.*, voxel_atlas.*, and
  voxel_entities.*.

